ields would be flooded","chinese":"每年冬季这些田地都会遭水淹"}]},{"id":"would:o:541b16d7b80b","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示特定条件下会出现的情况或可能性","glossesEn":["expressing ability, capacity"],"examples":[{"english":"the window wouldn't open","chinese":"这窗子就是打不开"},{"english":"our last car would hold six","chinese":"我们最后一辆汽车坐得下6个人"}]},{"id":"would:o:227c863c8699","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示恼火","glossesEn":["expressing annoyance"],"examples":[{"english":"they would have to be early","chinese":"他们非要提前不可"},{"english":"you would contradict him!","chinese":"你当然会跟他拌嘴！"}]},{"id":"would:o:25c01fd8e205","label":"modal.","definitionZh":"表示推测或设想","glossesEn":["expressing conjecture, assumption"],"examples":[{"english":"what time would that be?","chinese":"那会是什么时候？"},{"english":"being so young, you wouldn't remember the war","chinese":"你那时太小，不可能记得那场战争"}]}]}}}